[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6840.39, "timestamp": "01:54:00", "text": "从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6842.149, "timestamp": "01:54:02", "text": "呃，好像是群星环绕。嗯。抓住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6843.99, "timestamp": "01:54:03", "text": "在。为什么？让我再确认一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6845.51, "timestamp": "01:54:05", "text": "速度真快。哦，你得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6846.79, "timestamp": "01:54:06", "text": "导向螺栓也包含在内。这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6849.589, "timestamp": "01:54:09", "text": "拼写？哦，是的。好吧，没事了。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6853.27, "timestamp": "01:54:13", "text": "嗯，是的。稍等片刻。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6855.51, "timestamp": "01:54:15", "text": "好的，我要快速"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6858.31, "timestamp": "01:54:18", "text": "呃，删掉这个，因为它是重复的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6859.83, "timestamp": "01:54:19", "text": "我要移除你的一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6862.07, "timestamp": "01:54:22", "text": "因为它也是重复的，所以需要提供指导。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6865.27, "timestamp": "01:54:25", "text": "现在这边，嗯，你可以选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6866.95, "timestamp": "01:54:26", "text": "另一个 CAN 脚本。所以，让我来实际"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6869.51, "timestamp": "01:54:29", "text": "让我帮你打开导入程序，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6871.83, "timestamp": "01:54:31", "text": "你从那里选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6873.91, "timestamp": "01:54:33", "text": "等等，我现在都拥有什么？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6875.189, "timestamp": "01:54:35", "text": "忘了。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6877.27, "timestamp": "01:54:37", "text": "什么？哦，是的。你，你懂的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6879.83, "timestamp": "01:54:39", "text": "目前已有指导意见。呃，你得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6883.75, "timestamp": "01:54:43", "text": "色情鞭子，你得呃，制造火焰，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6887.03, "timestamp": "01:54:47", "text": "你得到了指导，产生了火焰，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6888.709, "timestamp": "01:54:48", "text": "正确的？光。是的。好的。是的。这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6891.03, "timestamp": "01:54:51", "text": "这边可以看到。你可以选择"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6894.31, "timestamp": "01:54:54", "text": "既然可以，那就再来一个吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6896.229, "timestamp": "01:54:56", "text": "从指导原则中切换了指导原则"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6899.27, "timestamp": "01:54:59", "text": "你从子类中得到的东西"}]